OL,3,ACzechs rally against plan to switch
OL,4,Afunding of public media
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have gathered in
OL,7,Fcentral Prague to protest against the
OL,8,FCzech government's plans to scrap the
OL,9,Flicence fee and use the state budget to
OL,10,Ffund public media.
OL,12,FCritics say the plans would allow
OL,13,Fpoliticians to stifle media freedom.
OL,15,FThe coalition government - which
OL,16,Fconsists of the populist ANO party and
OL,17,Ftwo right-wing Eurosceptic parties -
OL,18,Finsists the change will not affect
OL,19,Feditorial independence, but wants
OL,20,Fbroadcasters to cut costs.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
