OL,3,ACzechs rally against plan to switch
OL,4,Afunding of public media
OL,5,
OL,6,FParliament passed the first draft of
OL,7,Fthe proposal late last month. Since
OL,8,Fthen, thousands of Czechs have taken
OL,9,Fpart in protests.
